6. CLAUDE CODE EXECUTION RULES

Claude Code must follow:

6.1 Execution Constraints

Always treat JPL IR as immutable once generated

Never reinterpret graph semantics

Always preserve node IDs exactly

No "helpful simplification" allowed



---

6.2 Build Discipline

Claude Code must:

implement stateless functions for all metrics

ensure deterministic outputs for same inputs

never introduce probabilistic logic into core engine

never modify schema without version bump



---

6.3 Allowed Outputs

Python modules

SQL schema

CLI commands

JSON graph transformations

test suites



